{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>淳茶舍一連二十日大派純茶 完成1挑戰即送920毫升茶（附派發時間表）</figcaption></figure><p>秋意漸濃，是嘆茶的好時機。淳茶舍即日起，一連二十日快閃全港多區，包括尖沙咀、荃灣和旺角等人流熱點，免費向粉絲派發500毫升及920毫升純茶。即看下文！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059531/block/singleImage/3244426/df/01M5ENBGQ9X3WVKHKKFE4ZYXPV.jpg?updatedAt=1792653402\"/><figcaption>淳茶舍即日起，一連二十日免費派發500毫升及920毫升純茶。</figcaption></figure><p>完成挑戰即送920毫升純茶！ 淳茶舍即日起至11月10日期間，快閃全港多地免費派發5款純茶，包括烏龍茶、茉莉綠茶、大紅袍烏龍茶、雲抹綠茶及消茶普洱茶。粉絲只需追蹤淳茶舍的官方Instagram，即送500毫升茶；成功完成挑戰，即可獲得920毫升純茶，各位不妨一試！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059531/block/singleImage/3244429/df/01M5END1426549JCW6C5Y11TEW.jpg?updatedAt=1792653402\"/><figcaption>活動日程表</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:22:31.147319+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":280,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:55.555424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:55.555424+00:00","content_hash":"d60dd247a6e321e8fe7ba4d2b4057ce307691cceb32b38b9dcc9f6c2cb21df86","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}